# org.springframework:spring-core 5.3.39 (engine-spring/core, engine-spring) — this is
# a separate legacy Spring 5 compatibility module (property version.spring.framework,
# distinct from version.spring.framework6 used everywhere else). 5.3.39 is the newest
# release published in the 5.3.x line on Maven Central; there is no patched 5.3.x
# release for this CVE and jumping to Spring 6 would break the module's purpose
# (Spring 5 API compatibility). Escalated to Purwa as an open decision.
CVE-2025-41249

# angular (AngularJS) 1.8.2 (webapps/frontend) — AngularJS 1.x reached end-of-life;
